// The assistant of spark (docs/ai/assistant.md): spark starts it when it is switched on (Tools > Assistant) - as a native program once it is built, else with `forge run`.
// It connects to spark's MCP server and shows its own small window; it ends with spark. An argument is the character: sparky, flint or wick
// (none: the last one).
#import "assistant"

string character = ""
if (Environment.Args.length > 0) { character = Environment.Args[0] }
Assistant.App.Run(character, true)
